\f0\fs52 \cf2 \cb3 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Sales Anomaly Detection and Analysis\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 This project focuses on analyzing the\'a0
\f1 \cb4 sales_data_set.csv
\f0 \cb3 \'a0file to identify weekly sales anomalies, with a specific focus on understanding the underlying causes of negative sales instances.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa230\partightenfactor0

\fs46 \cf2 Project Goal\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 The primary goal of this project is to detect sales anomalies, particularly negative weekly sales, and to investigate the factors contributing to their occurrence. This analysis aims to provide insights for identifying potential data entry issues or return processing procedures in specific stores and departments.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa230\partightenfactor0

\fs46 \cf2 Data\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 The analysis uses the\'a0
\f1 \cb4 sales_data_set.csv
\f0 \cb3 \'a0file, which contains weekly sales data for various stores and departments.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa230\partightenfactor0

\fs46 \cf2 Methodology\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2\b\fs32 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Data Loading and Exploration:
\f0\b0 \'a0The dataset was loaded into a pandas DataFrame, and initial exploration was performed to understand the data structure, types, and identify potential issues like negative sales.\cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Anomaly Identification:
\f0\b0 \'a0Sales anomalies were identified by filtering for negative sales and applying the Isolation Forest algorithm to detect outliers in the weekly sales data.\cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Feature Engineering:
\f0\b0 \'a0New features were engineered to capture temporal patterns and deviations from typical sales trends, including rolling means and standard deviations of weekly sales over different time windows, and lagged sales values.\cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Addressing Class Imbalance:
\f0\b0 \'a0Recognizing the imbalanced nature of the dataset (anomalies being the minority class), the training data was oversampled using RandomOverSampler.\cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Model Development and Evaluation:
\f0\b0 \'a0Multiple anomaly detection models and ensemble methods, including Decision Trees (baseline and tuned), LightGBM, XGBoost, and BalancedRandomForestClassifier, were developed and evaluated using metrics appropriate for imbalanced classification (Precision, Recall, F1-score).\cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Model Interpretation:
\f0\b0 \'a0The best-performing model was analyzed to understand the importance of different features in predicting anomalies.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa230\partightenfactor0

\fs46 \cf2 \cb3 Key Findings\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\fs32 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Negative values and unusually high values in 'Weekly_Sales' were identified as significant anomalies.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Addressing class imbalance and engineering temporal features (rolling statistics and lagged sales) significantly improved model performance.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Ensemble methods, particularly the\'a0
\f2\b BalancedRandomForestClassifier
\f0\b0 , outperformed simpler models in detecting anomalies, achieving a high F1-score (0.93), Precision (0.95), and Recall (0.91).\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Feature importance analysis revealed that deviations from recent sales trends (captured by rolling means, standard deviations, and lagged sales) are the most influential factors in predicting anomalies.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 While 'Store' and 'Dept' are still important, their relative influence is less significant compared to the temporal deviation features.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa230\partightenfactor0

\fs46 \cf2 \cb3 Insights into Negative Sales\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 The analysis indicates that negative sales are strongly associated with significant downward deviations from the typical sales patterns of specific stores and departments. The model highlights the conditions under which negative sales are likely to occur, pointing towards the need for targeted investigation into processes in high-incidence stores and departments during periods of unusual sales behavior.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa230\partightenfactor0

\fs46 \cf2 Next Steps\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\fs32 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Conduct targeted investigations in stores and departments with high occurrences of negative sales, focusing on reviewing data entry procedures, return processing, and system logs during identified anomalous periods.\cb1 \
\ls3\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Consider adjusting the decision threshold of the BalancedRandomForestClassifier based on specific business requirements to balance precision and recall.\cb1 \
\ls3\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Explore other advanced time series anomaly detection techniques for more granular temporal analysis.\cb1 \
